{"id": "s10-ka-practice-2", "title": "Practice 2: -ка, -ок, -ик", "blocks": [{"t": "note", "text": "Sentences and their English: Tatoeba (tatoeba.org, CC BY 2.0 FR). Words, meanings and how each word is built: the English Wiktionary (CC BY-SA 4.0)."}], "exercises": [{"type": "fill", "q": "круг → ___", "answers": ["кружок", "кружок"], "hint": "the noun in -ок", "why": "**кружок** — (small) circle, ring. Wiktionary: круг + -о́к.", "id": "q1"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "кус → ___", "answers": ["кусок", "кусок"], "hint": "the noun in -ок", "why": "**кусок** — piece. Wiktionary: кус + -ок.", "id": "q2"}, {"type": "match", "q": "Match each word with its meaning (Wiktionary's definitions).", "pairs": [["ста́вка", "bet, wager"], ["висок", "(anatomy) temple"], ["кружок", "(small) circle, ring"], ["кусок", "piece"]], "why": "From Wiktionary: ста́вка — bet, wager; висок — (anatomy) temple; кружок — (small) circle, ring; кусок — piece.", "id": "q3"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "поступи́ть → ___", "answers": ["поступок", "посту́пок"], "hint": "the noun in -ок", "why": "**посту́пок** — act, action, behaviour, conduct, deed. Wiktionary: поступи́ть + -ок.", "id": "q4"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "шути́ть → ___", "answers": ["шутка", "шу́тка"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**шу́тка** — joke. Wiktionary: шути́ть + -ка.", "id": "q5"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "ошиба́ться → ___", "answers": ["ошибка", "оши́бка"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**оши́бка** — mistake, error, fault. Wiktionary: ошиба́ться + -ка.", "id": "q6"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "записа́ть → ___", "answers": ["записка", "запи́ска"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**запи́ска** — note, memo (memorandum). Wiktionary: записа́ть + -ка.", "id": "q7"}, {"type": "match", "q": "Match each word with its meaning (Wiktionary's definitions).", "pairs": [["посту́пок", "act, action, behaviour, conduct, deed"], ["шу́тка", "joke"], ["оши́бка", "mistake, error, fault"], ["запи́ска", "note, memo (memorandum)"]], "why": "From Wiktionary: посту́пок — act, action, behaviour, conduct, deed; шу́тка — joke; оши́бка — mistake, error, fault; запи́ска — note, memo (memorandum).", "id": "q8"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "печь → ___", "answers": ["печка", "пе́чка"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**пе́чка** — stove, oven. Wiktionary: печь + -ка.", "id": "q9"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "посади́ть → ___", "answers": ["посадка", "поса́дка"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**поса́дка** — planting. Wiktionary: посади́ть + -ка.", "id": "q10"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "бесе́да → ___", "answers": ["беседка", "бесе́дка"], "hint": "the noun in -ка", "why": "**бесе́дка** — arbor, gazebo, pavilion (a shady place for sitting). Wiktionary: бесе́да + -ка.", "id": "q11"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "пры́гать → ___", "answers": ["прыжок", "прыжок"], "hint": "the noun in -ок", "why": "**прыжок** — jump, leap, bound. Wiktionary: пры́гать + -о́к.", "id": "q12"}]}